# Hayflick level - creative mode writes this file back; review edits with
# git diff. grid_hash is the level identity: editing the grid invalidates
# recorded traces and pinned state hashes for this level.
# Grammar: size W H | spawn X Z | lamp X Z GLOW | room X Z | wallx X Z | wallz X Z
#          paint rain|soot|spall X Y Z +x|-x|+z|-z R
#          grow grass|dry|mow|scorch X Z R | plant tree|bush X Z SEED
#          neighborhood | floor road|walk|soil X0 Z0 X1 Z1 | pothole X Z R
#          window X Z | roof X0 Z0 X1 Z1 | prop KIND X Z YAW SEED
#          exit X0 Z0 X1 Z1 SX SZ LEVEL NAME
size 26 23
neighborhood
spawn 12 15
